    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Forgefather's Seekers",
    "summary": "You can pick the **devastator doctrine** of [Combat Doctrines](vsdata:ability/space-marines.combat-doctrines) an extra time in the battle.\n\nRanged attacks by your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units against a unit up to 12\" from them get +1 S.\n\nWhile your army includes **VULKAN HE’STAN**, your **INFERNUS SQUAD** units get these:\n\n- an [advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) by the unit leaves it free to [start an action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)\n- starting an [action](vsdata:core-rule/actions) leaves the unit free to shoot\n\nYour army can contain **SALAMANDERS** units, and no **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units of any other Chapter.",
